# The world rewrites its law of growth until its life is in balance:
# crowded under the law it starts with, it writes another every twenty
# frames while it stays crowded, and once in balance the law stands.
# What it writes is kept for the run; laws/grow.ent stays the seed.
scene ../scene.esn
allow file.write ../laws/
frame 0.0 to 2.0 every 0.05
expect tuning.result[2] >= 1
frame 2.05 to 9.0 every 0.05
expect tuning.result[2] >= 4
expect census.result[0] >= 4800
expect census.result[0] <= 5952
